er the Advanta, Alta Seeds, Pacific Seeds, and Hannaford brands. In addition, the company offers industrial and specialty chemicals, such as phosphorus, cynation, phosgenation, and acrolein; other non-agricultural related products; post-harvest solutions; farmer education and engagement; environmental electronics; and apiculture services, as well as operates nurture.farm, a digital platform for growers, farming communities, and food systems. It serves input suppliers, distributors, farmers, food wholesalers/traders, food manufacturers, food retailers, consumers, industry associations, media, cooperatives, government, restaurants, agriculture chemical distributors, and non-government organisations. The company exports its products. The company was formerly known as United Phosphorus Limited and changed its name to UPL Limited in October 2013. UPL Limited was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India."}}